  ],
  "saferAlternatives": [
    "Set GARMIN_READ_ONLY=true: the four tools that change the account are not listed and the server rejects them if a client calls them anyway.",
    "The write tools carry MCP annotations (readOnlyHint false; delete_workout and unschedule_workout also destructiveHint true), so clients can ask before running them.",
    "Garmin credentials come from environment variables and are only sent to Garmin Connect. The server keeps HRV and form history in ~/.garmin-connect-mcp.",
    "Pin the package version when launching with npx (for example garmin-coach-mcp@0.6.0) so only the reviewed release runs."
  ]
